From 67db477c47ec42d57a27bd18dbb314487dc9d0c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add discrete power, HDMI inputs and playback to Sony
 Bravia Infrared

Uses POWER_ON and POWER_OFF and the new SonyTVExtendedCode table from
infrared-protocols. The media player gets assumed power state, source
select for TV and HDMI 1 to 4, and play, pause and stop, with the state
restored across restarts. The new keys are also buttons and event types.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RrPaBaU6zM6AhoWcyUefct
